        "closing": "Fitch gets Bramble calmed and the cart rolling at a walk, one-handed if he's hurt; Tansy back on top of the cushions with a goblin arrow she means to keep. The player goes ahead toward the smoke. End on the road east, the smoke going up black over the river, a horn.",
