    {
      "id": "beaten-up",
      "type": "story",
      "position": {
        "x": 1260,
        "y": 360
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "exit",
        "title": "Beaten up",
        "description": "The fight went against the player: they went down, ran from it or walked away from the cart, and the hedge-gang made off east with an armful of cushions and Fitch's flask, jeering. Fitch got the player back on their feet (or onto the cart), and there's nothing for it but the bridge, where the smoke is.",
        "closing": "Fitch hauls the player up onto the cart beside him, swearing gently; Tansy hands them a cushion to sit on, solemnly. The cart creaks on toward the smoke. End on the road east, the light going.",
        "result": "mixed",
        "exitKind": "progress",
        "next": "toll-bridge",
        "effects": [
          {
            "op": "quest",
            "quest": "assembly-cushions",
            "do": "advance",
            "stage": "beaten",
            "text": "The hedge-goblins had the better of it at the crossroads and made off with some of the cushions. On to Garrow's toll bridge, where the King's patrol is meant to be."
          },
          {
            "op": "remember",
            "who": "fitch",
